  "category": "environment",
  "status": "provisional",
  "comment": "THE GLOWMIRE: black water and teal fog — dead trees, stilts, lanterns on posts and giant mushrooms that shine under their caps. What makes the zone that zone: the three seamless strips of its backdrop, tall enough for the camera of every room of it; the ground its rooms are built of; the pieces that stand, lie and hang in them; and the light in its colour. Painted by the generator in tools/art (npm run art:build), not by a person: provisional until an artist reviews or replaces it.",
